{"id":"31c707c261cc66f2","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness.md","title":"原书四字母固有歧义语言","display":"thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness — 原书四字母固有歧义语言","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness","aliases":["73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness"],"display":"thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness — 原书四字母固有歧义语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§5.4.4, print pp. 213–215; PDF pp. 235–237; Figure 5.22","source_status":"source-statement-checked; textbook explicitly omits complete inherent-ambiguity proof","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 4.7, pp. 100–103; scans 108–111","legacy_source_status":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":5},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness — 原书四字母固有歧义语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3d61b5dd7be385b\" href=\"?note=a3d61b5dd7be385b\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ambiguity\">73-df-cfg-ambiguity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§5.4.4, print pp. 213–215; PDF pp. 235–237; Figure 5.22"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; textbook explicitly omits complete inherent-ambiguity proof"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 4.7, pp. 100–103; scans 108–111"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}\\)</span> 是含四个互异字符的字母表。固有歧义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3d61b5dd7be385b\" href=\"?note=a3d61b5dd7be385b\" title=\"73-df-cfg-ambiguity\">73-df-cfg-ambiguity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 在集合构造中绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inherent\\text{-}ambiguity\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{ia}}\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^nc^md^m:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\\cup\\{a^nb^mc^md^n:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inherent\\text{-}ambiguity\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{ia}}\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^nc^md^m:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\\cup\\{a^nb^mc^md^n:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inherent\\text{-}ambiguity\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{ia}}\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{InherentlyAmbiguous}_{\\Sigma}(L_{\\mathsf{ia}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inherent\\text{-}ambiguity\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{ia}}\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{InherentlyAmbiguous}_{\\Sigma}(L_{\\mathsf{ia}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第三版 §5.4.4, pp.213–215（PDF pp.235–237）保留同一个四块语言，Figure 5.22 给出两分支文法。两分支分别保持 a/b、c/d 相等，或 a/d、b/c 相等；aⁿbⁿcⁿdⁿ 同时属于两分支。教材明确说不提供“所有文法都歧义”的完整证明，只给直观，因此本条的固有歧义结论仅核对了来源陈述；两分支文法的歧义不能单独证明固有歧义。旧版完整证明的历史定位仍保留于 legacy_source_ref。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-ambiguity","status":"resolved","id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}$ 是含四个互异字符的字母表。固有歧义见 [[73-df-cfg-ambiguity]]；$n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$ 在集合构造中绑定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inherent\\text{-}ambiguity\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{ia}}\\coloneqq\\{a^nb^nc^md^m:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\}\\cup\\{a^nb^mc^md^n:n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inherent\\text{-}ambiguity\\text{-}witness}\\vdash\nL_{\\mathsf{ia}}\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{InherentlyAmbiguous}_{\\Sigma}(L_{\\mathsf{ia}})","display":true}],"bytes":1945,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness|原书四字母固有歧义语言]]"},{"id":"4e66eeecae0f34b7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a,b,c,d\\}$，$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$ 且 $|\\Sigma|=4$。DCFL 见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]；无歧义性质与原书的固有歧义见证见 [[73-thm-dcfl-unambiguous-grammar]]、[[73-thm-inherent-ambiguity-witness]]。"}],"outgoing":["a3d61b5dd7be385b"]}